{
  "sn11.1:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 11.1 ",
  "sn11.1:0.2": "1. Paṭhamavagga ",
  "sn11.1:0.3": "Suvīrasutta ",
  "sn11.1:1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
  "sn11.1:1.2": "ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā sāvatthiyaṁ viharati jetavane anāthapiṇḍikassa ārāme. ",
  "sn11.1:1.3": "Tatra kho bhagavā bhikkhū āmantesi: ",
  "sn11.1:1.4": "“bhikkhavo”ti. ",
  "sn11.1:1.5": "“Bhadante”ti te bhikkhū bhagavato paccassosuṁ. ",
  "sn11.1:1.6": "Bhagavā etadavoca: ",
  "sn11.1:2.1": "“Bhūtapubbaṁ, bhikkhave, asurā deve abhiyaṁsu. ",
  "sn11.1:2.2": "Atha kho, bhikkhave, sakko devānamindo suvīraṁ devaputtaṁ āmantesi: ",
  "sn11.1:2.3": "‘ete, tāta suvīra, asurā deve abhiyanti. ",
  "sn11.1:2.4": "Gaccha, tāta suvīra, asure paccuyyāhī’ti. ",
  "sn11.1:2.5": "‘Evaṁ, bhaddantavā’ti kho, bhikkhave, suvīro devaputto sakkassa devānamindassa paṭissutvā pamādaṁ āpādesi. ",
  "sn11.1:2.6": "Dutiyampi kho, bhikkhave, sakko devānamindo suvīraṁ devaputtaṁ āmantesi: ",
  "sn11.1:2.7": "‘ete, tāta suvīra, asurā deve abhiyanti. ",
  "sn11.1:2.8": "Gaccha, tāta suvīra, asure paccuyyāhī’ti. ",
  "sn11.1:2.9": "‘Evaṁ, bhaddantavā’ti kho, bhikkhave, suvīro devaputto sakkassa devānamindassa paṭissutvā dutiyampi pamādaṁ āpādesi. ",
  "sn11.1:2.10": "Tatiyampi kho, bhikkhave, sakko devānamindo suvīraṁ devaputtaṁ āmantesi: ",
  "sn11.1:2.11": "‘ete, tāta suvīra, asurā deve abhiyanti. ",
  "sn11.1:2.12": "Gaccha, tāta suvīra, asure paccuy